{"id":"662096","name":"番茄金针菇豆腐汤","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/662096/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"1个"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"500g"},{"name":"水豆腐","amount":"两块"},{"name":"鸡肉肠","amount":"2条"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄切小块。","img":"images/662096/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"金针菇切成一厘米长。","img":"images/662096/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水豆腐切小块。","img":"images/662096/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡肉肠切小块。","img":"images/662096/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入适量水，倒入少许食用油，烧开后加入盐。","img":"images/662096/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入番茄，煮出茄汁。","img":"images/662096/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再把其余的材料全部放入。","img":"images/662096/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入胡椒粉、鸡粉。","img":"images/662096/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再淋入生抽，搅拌一下。","img":"images/662096/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烧开后转中火，大概再煮3分钟即可盛出。","img":"images/662096/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}